# q-hover-pan (h8-plane): a press and move on the plane pans it: no Q shows
# while panning. The shot holds the drag.
# Behaviour: url line (empty query, still debouncing); no q line.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 500
move 1000 490
down
move 1040 490 over 80
shot q-hover-pan
up
wait 1200
